  "question": {
    "text": "A sample of gas at temperature <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math> is adiabatically expanded to double its volume. The work done by the gas in the process is given, (given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>)&nbsp;:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Work done by gas in adiabatic process is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;For an adiabatic process,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msup><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, work done is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>-</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
  }
